@UserManagementAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5120
@BearerToken = demo-token-123

### Root endpoint
GET {{UserManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/
Accept: text/plain
Authorization: Bearer {{BearerToken}}

### Test exception middleware
GET {{UserManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/throw
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{BearerToken}}

### Get all users
GET {{UserManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/usercontrollers
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{BearerToken}}

### Get user by id
GET {{UserManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/usercontrollers/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{BearerToken}}

### Create user
POST {{UserManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/usercontrollers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{BearerToken}}

{
  "name": "Jane Doe",
  "email": "jane@example.com"
}

### Update user
PUT {{UserManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/usercontrollers/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{BearerToken}}

{
  "name": "Alice Updated",
  "email": "alice.updated@example.com"
}

### Delete user
DELETE {{UserManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/usercontrollers/2
Authorization: Bearer {{BearerToken}}

### Unauthorized test endpoint (should return 401)
GET {{UserManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/usercontrollers/999
Accept: application/json

###
